        "duration": 35937501
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "和用异或门：相同得零，不同得一。",
        "offset": 65625002,
        "duration": 37379809
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "进位用与门：只有两个一相加，才进位。",
        "offset": 103004811,
        "duration": 37139424
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "两个门拼起来，就是半加器。",
